+Route/resource facts from source:
+
+- `P_STAGE_SLOTS=2`, from `..._pstage2...`.
+- `P_SCALE_TMEM_SLOTS=2` because direct online P scale uses non-aliased async P-scale TMEM.
+- `V_SCALE_TMEM_SLOTS=2`; V-scale ping-pong is intact.
+- `ONLINE_PRODUCER_ASYNC_V_SCALE_TMEM=true` through the direct P-scale base route.
+- `ONLINE_STAGE_V_SCALE_BEFORE_NEXT_QK=false` for this route; the default trait is false and the kept qkscfix config does not override it.
+- `ONLINE_FOLD_P_SCALE_REUSE_WITH_P_STAGE=true` and `ONLINE_SKIP_FOLDED_P_SCALE_REUSE_ARRIVE=true`; P-scale slot reuse is folded into `p_stage_reusable`.
+- Direct P scale x1 store uses `tcgen05.st.sync.aligned.32x32b.x1.b32`; completion is ordered by `tcgen05.wait::st.sync.aligned`.
