+- `OUTPUT_TMEM_SLOTS = 1` because spare output accumulation aliases score TMEM instead of allocating a second output tile.
+- `SCALE_TMEM_BASE = SCORE_TMEM_WIDTH + OUTPUT_TMEM_SLOTS * C::Dvo = 256 + 128 = 384`.
+- Compact Q scale: 16 columns at 384..399.
+- K scale: 16 columns at 400..415.
+- P scale: `P_SCALE_TMEM_SLOTS = 2`, width 16 each, at 416..431 and 432..447.
