+- Existing cluster2 load sites are not multicast broadcasts: Q, Q scale, K, K scale, and legacy BF16 V all pass single-rank masks `(uint16_t)(1 << cta_rank)`.
+- Current online Q ownership is rank-distinct: `q_tile_idx = min(t_coord.y + cta_rank, tiles_m - 1)`.
+- Current online K ownership is rank-distinct: `k_tile_idx = min(global_idx * C::CLUSTER_SIZE + cta_rank, k_tile_limit)`.
